<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; subdirectory &quot;annotationData&quot; if you call list.files().  You may find
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; the following page useful too:
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;   <a href="http://aroma-project.org/troubleshooting/DirectoryStructures" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://aroma-project.org/troubleshooting/DirectoryStructures&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230570007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Wq8w424yUc7VqnZsaLq_0">http://aroma-project.org/troubleshooting/DirectoryStructures</a>
