<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; R install packages and you shouldn&#39;t add/remove things from there.
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; For instance, if you uninstall aroma.affymetrix then all your data may
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; disappear as well.  Instead, let your working directory be something
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; like:
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
<br>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;   C:/Users/nwayyin/AromaAnalysis/
